{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-08","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"chemistry","number":8,"points":null,"unitId":"solution","unitLabel":"용액·총괄성","topic":"이상용액·몰분율","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["solution","phase"],"stem":"그림은35℃의클로로포름과아세톤혼합용액에서클로로포름의\n몰분율에따른각성분의증기압을나타낸것이다. 점선(\n)은혼합\n용액이이상용액이라고가정할때각성분의증기압을나타낸것이다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 아세톤분자사이의인력은클로로포름분자사이의인력\n보다크다.\nㄴ. 아세톤과클로로포름분자사이의인력은아세톤분자\n사이의인력이나클로로포름분자사이의인력보다크다.\nㄷ. 클로로포름의몰분율이0.6인용액과평형을이루고있는\n9\n증기속에서클로로포름의몰분율은\n23 이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":44,"height":7,"region":0,"bbox":[268.755,27.792,17.6,2.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-08/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":604,"height":537,"region":0,"bbox":[43.155,69.392,241.6,214.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-08/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":773,"height":319,"region":0,"bbox":[14.355,327.792,309.2,127.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-deet-science2-08/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[429.645,529.008,758.256,1032.843],"width":328.611,"height":503.835,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[268.755,27.792,17.6,2.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":